ng Dashboard**:\n   - Visual live dashboard with CPU/Memory usage graphs, request throughput, and live verification telemetry.\n3. **Infrastructure-as-Code (Terraform & Kubernetes)**:\n   - Add a `terraform/` folder for automated cloud provisioning (AWS/Azure/GCP) + Kubernetes YAML manifests (`k8s/`).\n4. **Agentic AI Verification Assistant**:\n   - Add an intelligent AI Fraud Detection & Smart Query Assistant to analyze suspicious certificate requests.\n\n---\n\n**Would you like me to implement these bonus features now to secure the maximum 10 bonus marks?**","thinking":"The primary deployment requirement is a Docker container or a cloud platform solution, such as AWS, Azure, or GCP. Potential bonus marks are available for implementing advanced features like agentic AI integration, blockchain-based credential verification, robust security mechanisms, real-time monitoring, or infrastructure-as-code. These optional features provide opportunities for extra credit.\n\n\nDeployment and advanced security are fully realized. Partially implemented features include blockchain credential verification, where a blockchain verification engine needs to be added for compliance, and real-time monitoring, which requires a live metrics dashboard.\n\n\n"}
